title: "Mekong discharge forecasting: a research prototype on simulated GloFAS discharge"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Chantha
    given-names: Thy
repository-code: "https://github.com/THYCHANTHA/mekong-flood-forecasting"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-31
abstract: >-
  Forecasting of model-simulated (GloFAS v4) Mekong discharge with an adapter architecture
  that allows authorised MRC gauge observations to be added later. Research prototype; not a
  flood warning system and no claim of real-world forecast accuracy.
